WEBVTT

00:00:06.591 --> 00:00:09.560
Disgaea

00:00:10.395 --> 00:00:15.856
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:20.927
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:23.241 --> 00:00:28.645
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:33.878
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:36.121 --> 00:00:42.424
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:48.659
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:54.831
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:55.407 --> 00:01:01.539
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:08.051
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:08.153 --> 00:01:11.384
Ah aishitageru,

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.888
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:19.831 --> 00:01:22.527
Aishitageru.

00:01:41.653 --> 00:01:45.020
Wow, I see something swirling
down there...

00:01:45.891 --> 00:01:48.917
If you fell into that, there's no telling
where you'd be sent off to!

00:01:49.127 --> 00:01:50.355
Sent off to?

00:01:51.296 --> 00:01:53.287
Wait a minute! Don't tell me
that you don't know...

00:01:53.398 --> 00:01:56.094
...why we've been taking all this time
walking on the ground?

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:58.334
No. Why are we?

00:01:58.436 --> 00:02:03.396
Look, there's no cohesion in the void
between one floating island and the next.

00:02:03.508 --> 00:02:06.033
So if you get careless and fall in,
there's no telling...

00:02:06.144 --> 00:02:08.669
I'm trying, but I still
don't understand...

00:02:08.813 --> 00:02:11.407
If you can't wrap your head around, maybe
some firsthand experience will help!

00:02:18.023 --> 00:02:19.581
Highness, that was
just plain mean!

00:02:19.991 --> 00:02:21.959
What, do you want
to give it a try, too?

00:02:22.294 --> 00:02:23.420
Sir! No, sir!

00:02:24.162 --> 00:02:26.392
If we're clear on that,
get your tail in gear.

00:02:26.731 --> 00:02:27.925
Roger!

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:32.932
That was mean, Laharl!
Huh?

00:02:33.405 --> 00:02:34.872
Wow, is this
a miracle?

00:02:38.643 --> 00:02:39.803
I guess not.

00:02:39.911 --> 00:02:41.811
What's the holdup back there?
Get a move on!

00:02:41.947 --> 00:02:43.346
Coming!

00:02:43.848 --> 00:02:45.782
Wait for me!

00:02:46.318 --> 00:02:49.253
Laharl! Etna!
Please don't leave me!

00:02:49.354 --> 00:02:50.582
Help me!

00:02:50.689 --> 00:02:56.650
Etna's Embarrassing Secret

00:02:58.697 --> 00:03:01.825
So, that's the castle of the criminal mastermind
who put a bounty on my head, huh?

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:04.665
It's just like Saldia said.

00:03:05.203 --> 00:03:07.137
"Go through the Evil Forest,"

00:03:07.706 --> 00:03:10.334
"crawl along the
Cliffs of Despair,"

00:03:10.675 --> 00:03:13.667
"and cross the Rope Bridge
of the Damned, and there shall ye find..."

00:03:13.812 --> 00:03:15.370
"...the castle that
ye seeketh."

00:03:15.513 --> 00:03:17.947
But remember, she also said,
"Maybe, maybe not."

00:03:18.116 --> 00:03:20.710
So this might belong to
another demon entirely.

00:03:21.052 --> 00:03:22.713
We'll find out soon enough
when we get there.

00:03:22.821 --> 00:03:24.982
All right, let's go claim
that bounty.

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.216
Yeah!

00:03:31.396 --> 00:03:33.694
A flower petal?
Where'd it come from?

00:03:34.232 --> 00:03:36.564
C'mon, Flonne!
We're gonna leave you behind!

00:03:37.135 --> 00:03:39.194
Wait for me!

00:03:50.348 --> 00:03:52.407
The place sure looks the part,
doesn't it?

00:03:58.423 --> 00:04:02.189
The Master will be with you shortly.
Please wait here.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.425
That's very kind
of you.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.428
Thank you so much!

00:04:10.101 --> 00:04:12.228
Well, well, well.
What have we here?

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.629
I should have known
it was you.

00:04:16.641 --> 00:04:19.109
Hi, Highness!
It's been too long!

00:04:19.444 --> 00:04:22.140
Wilkommen to Maderas Castle!
Welcome!

00:04:23.682 --> 00:04:27.846
Who is he? Is this wriggly demon
an acquaintance of yours?

00:04:28.186 --> 00:04:30.780
"Wriggly" demon, indeed!
Such a rude girl you are!

00:04:30.955 --> 00:04:33.788
His name is Maderas. He was
banished from the castle...

00:04:33.892 --> 00:04:37.487
...for stealing my old man's favorite snack,
steamed buns of the damned.

00:04:38.096 --> 00:04:40.360
Maderas, that's me!
Yay!

00:04:40.665 --> 00:04:41.996
Yay...

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.862
Still, since you're a familiar face,
that will make things easier.

00:04:45.003 --> 00:04:46.971
It'll save me the trouble
of negotiating.

00:04:47.405 --> 00:04:49.669
Now, how about forking
over the bounty...

00:04:49.941 --> 00:04:53.604
...that you so graciously put on the
head of the great Overlord Laharl?!

00:04:53.812 --> 00:04:56.110
Yeah, but make the check
payable to me!

00:04:56.514 --> 00:04:57.105
What?

00:04:57.215 --> 00:05:01.117
No offense, Highness, but you're the most
gullible demon in the Netherworld.

00:05:01.753 --> 00:05:03.584
It's almost funny.

00:05:06.057 --> 00:05:08.355
Highness! Say "ah"!

00:05:10.862 --> 00:05:13.387
Buh-bye, Highness!
Flonne!

00:05:13.498 --> 00:05:16.956
Auf wiedersehen, Highness!
You can call me Overlord Maderas!

00:05:17.836 --> 00:05:19.963
I'm so wonderful!

00:05:26.478 --> 00:05:27.570
Where are we?

00:05:27.712 --> 00:05:29.612
I have no idea...

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.742
What's the deal
with this place?

00:05:33.918 --> 00:05:35.977
Oh, my!
Are we awake?

00:05:37.589 --> 00:05:42.925
Laharl, that wriggly, creepy demon
has grown to gigantic proportions!

00:05:43.094 --> 00:05:46.188
You have it backwards.
We're the ones who have gotten small.

00:05:47.832 --> 00:05:50.198
That's my prince!
You catch on so quickly!

00:05:50.335 --> 00:05:51.359
Etna!

00:05:51.436 --> 00:05:53.529
Hi there,
itty-bitty Flonne!

00:05:53.738 --> 00:05:56.969
Etna, you have some nerve,
tricking me like this!

00:05:57.375 --> 00:06:02.870
I'm real sorry about that, but for various
reasons, I can't disobey Maderas' orders!

00:06:04.182 --> 00:06:07.674
Etna is my utterly obedient
and faithful pet dog!

00:06:08.453 --> 00:06:10.546
It was she who tossed you
into the crypt!

00:06:11.055 --> 00:06:13.421
It was she who
tipped off Saldia!

00:06:13.758 --> 00:06:17.819
And it was she who had the Prinnies circulate
those flyers! It was all Etna's doing!

00:06:18.663 --> 00:06:19.595
Yay!

00:06:20.031 --> 00:06:21.055
It can't be...

00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:23.691
So, what is it that you two
hope to get out of this?

00:06:23.868 --> 00:06:27.804
To be perfectly honest, you stand
between me and the Overlord's throne.

00:06:28.039 --> 00:06:32.169
Huh? Tell me, Maderas. Just now, did you
say that you were going to be Overlord?

00:06:32.343 --> 00:06:34.208
Yes! That's right!

00:06:34.612 --> 00:06:39.447
What a lame joke. I'll never let a
pathetic bozo like you be Overlord.

00:06:39.684 --> 00:06:42.983
The only Overlord around here is me!
Chew on this!

00:06:48.827 --> 00:06:53.264
You can't do a thing while you're in there!
Even your Overlord's Wrath spell is blocked!

00:06:54.632 --> 00:06:56.566
I'm such a genius!

00:06:56.734 --> 00:07:00.534
That's my Maderas! The demon
who will be Overlord! Maybe!

00:07:00.638 --> 00:07:02.868
When it comes to dirty tricks,
you're the best in the Netherworld!

00:07:04.542 --> 00:07:08.444
I can't believe it. I simply can't believe
that Etna would betray us...

00:07:08.546 --> 00:07:11.379
Your enemies and allies can change
depending on the time and place.

00:07:11.516 --> 00:07:13.950
Demons aren't
to be trusted.

00:07:14.152 --> 00:07:16.313
That's what it is
to be a demon.

00:07:16.454 --> 00:07:17.716
You're kidding...

00:07:18.556 --> 00:07:22.720
Okay, you two! Spin the wheel, move forward
the number of spaces it says,

00:07:22.827 --> 00:07:26.923
and then spend all eternity acting out the
lives written on the space you land on!

00:07:27.465 --> 00:07:30.730
Oh, I am such
a genius!

00:07:34.472 --> 00:07:35.632
What does he mean?

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.875
Laharl!

00:07:48.386 --> 00:07:52.789
"Fall in with the wrong crowd, join a biker gang,
and climb the ranks to become gang leader"?

00:07:52.891 --> 00:07:56.224
What the hell? "Your dream is
to become a prima donna"?

00:08:07.639 --> 00:08:09.971
Lord Maderas? Lord Maderas?

00:08:10.241 --> 00:08:12.175
C'mon, give me what
you promised me!

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.039
Why, whatever could
you mean?

00:08:14.145 --> 00:08:17.911
Oh, you! Don't play coy with me,
you big tease!

00:08:18.383 --> 00:08:21.409
We both know that our deal was that if
I tricked the Prince into coming here,

00:08:21.519 --> 00:08:23.009
you'd give me my
memories back!

00:08:23.121 --> 00:08:27.148
AND that I'd also get all
the bounty as a reward.

00:08:27.425 --> 00:08:30.394
Oh, did I really
promise you that?

00:08:36.901 --> 00:08:40.098
What's the big idea?! Keep your word
and give me my memories back!

00:08:40.305 --> 00:08:44.503
Now, by "memories," do you mean that terribly
embarrassing set of memories?

00:08:44.609 --> 00:08:46.907
Yes, those! Hand 'em over!
Right now!

00:08:47.445 --> 00:08:50.039
Don't you "Right now" me, missy!
Now, go away!

00:08:50.148 --> 00:08:51.513
Shoo! Shoo! Shoo!

00:08:51.883 --> 00:08:55.319
Hey, what are you trying to pull?!
This isn't part of the deal!

00:08:55.553 --> 00:08:58.283
Hey! Open up!
Gimme back my memories!

00:08:58.423 --> 00:09:00.653
And fork over that bounty, too!
Gimme back my memories!

00:09:00.758 --> 00:09:05.252
Hush your mouth this instant! Or I'll plaster
your memories all over the Netherworld!

00:09:06.364 --> 00:09:10.027
Honestly, her and her "deal" nonsense...
What a fool.

00:09:10.134 --> 00:09:13.126
What self-respecting demon
would keep a promise?

00:09:13.237 --> 00:09:15.102
Isn't that right,
Highness?

00:09:15.873 --> 00:09:19.240
Do you suppose that Etna was tricked
by that wriggly demon?

00:09:26.751 --> 00:09:28.981
I KNEW that's where
he's keeping them...

00:09:29.821 --> 00:09:32.790
Krichevskoy, I hated that man
so much.

00:09:33.057 --> 00:09:35.025
Honestly, choking on a
steamed bun like that...

00:09:36.461 --> 00:09:40.659
It serves him right, dying in such
a stupid, undignified way.

00:09:41.399 --> 00:09:44.425
I don't like being forced to
listen to his ramblings,

00:09:45.103 --> 00:09:48.334
but I like being turned into
a game piece even less!

00:09:48.439 --> 00:09:49.872
Duh, why's that?

00:09:50.808 --> 00:09:52.537
Oh, now what?!

00:09:53.211 --> 00:09:56.874
Now, then, I think I'll go
take a sweat in the bath...

00:10:13.064 --> 00:10:15.532
Okay, those memories
are mine!

00:10:21.205 --> 00:10:23.173
Disgaea

00:10:24.242 --> 00:10:30.181
Disgaea

00:10:31.115 --> 00:10:33.242
Howdy, boys!

00:10:35.853 --> 00:10:38.253
What? I don't get it,
why aren't they here?

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:41.520
Oh, your memories
aren't in there.

00:10:42.427 --> 00:10:43.917
I've been spotted, huh?

00:10:46.597 --> 00:10:48.656
If they aren't here,
where are they?

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:52.097
Oh, my, what's with this attitude?
That isn't very ladylike.

00:10:52.203 --> 00:10:56.333
Hurry up and gimme back my memories,
you double-dealing, wriggly weirdo!

00:10:56.507 --> 00:11:00.603
Oh, I do so love being
called double-dealing!

00:11:01.512 --> 00:11:04.345
You lying little worm!
You sneak!

00:11:04.449 --> 00:11:06.280
Turds-for-brains!
Go to hell!

00:11:06.384 --> 00:11:09.876
Oh, being called names
feels so good!

00:11:09.987 --> 00:11:10.954
You're a dead man!

00:11:11.722 --> 00:11:13.087
Are you some kind
of idiot?

00:11:13.291 --> 00:11:16.454
Anyway, how important could memories
that you threw away possibly be?

00:11:16.561 --> 00:11:17.892
None of your business!
Just give 'em back!

00:11:17.995 --> 00:11:20.896
I'd die of shame if embarrassing memories
like those were made public!

00:11:21.265 --> 00:11:23.927
Perhaps, but since I found them,
they belong to me now.

00:11:24.035 --> 00:11:26.026
I've separated your memories
into three categories:

00:11:26.137 --> 00:11:27.604
"Slightly Embarrassing
Memories,"

00:11:27.705 --> 00:11:29.798
"Moderately Embarrassing
Memories,"

00:11:29.907 --> 00:11:31.807
and "Extremely Embarrassing
Memories."

00:11:31.909 --> 00:11:34.878
I've hidden them somewhere
in the castle.

00:11:34.979 --> 00:11:36.105
Hidden where?!

00:11:36.214 --> 00:11:37.841
I can't tell you that.

00:11:37.949 --> 00:11:43.910
I need to have you continue to serve me
as my faithful dog for a while yet.

00:11:44.422 --> 00:11:48.654
Why, you little... How much longer are
you gonna keep exploiting my weakness?!

00:11:48.926 --> 00:11:50.120
You sleaze!

00:11:50.228 --> 00:11:51.889
Yes! Yell at me
some more!

00:11:51.996 --> 00:11:57.093
Now we know the truth, Laharl! Etna was
being blackmailed by that wriggly demon!

00:11:57.535 --> 00:12:01.232
Maderas always was a coward who took
advantage of his opponents' weaknesses.

00:12:01.772 --> 00:12:05.264
But that doesn't change the fact
that Etna betrayed me.

00:12:11.349 --> 00:12:14.716
Oh, please, Lord Maderas,
give me back my memories!

00:12:14.819 --> 00:12:17.879
Just give me back my memories,
I don't need any reward!

00:12:20.091 --> 00:12:23.959
All right, toss the game board into the
fireplace and burn it, Prince and all.

00:12:25.863 --> 00:12:30.493
With the Prince dead, the throne is as good as
mine, and you will have your memories back.

00:12:30.601 --> 00:12:32.501
The two of us live
happily ever after.

00:12:42.346 --> 00:12:45.577
Well, you heard the man!
Nothing personal, guys!

00:12:51.989 --> 00:12:55.152
Now my selection as the
next Overlord is secure!

00:12:55.326 --> 00:12:58.318
Okay, NOW are you going to
give me back my memories?

00:12:58.729 --> 00:13:01.323
Oh, is that what
I said?

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:03.758
Beauty!

00:13:09.707 --> 00:13:13.370
Wherever there are teardrops that fall
upon the lovely flowers of the fields,

00:13:13.511 --> 00:13:17.072
my smile will be there to gently wipe them
away like the wind! In flower language, I am...

00:13:17.181 --> 00:13:17.772
Who's that?

00:13:18.749 --> 00:13:22.048
I-I can't see a thing!
I'm blind as a bat!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.586
All right, then!
B-Beauty!

00:13:38.202 --> 00:13:41.729
Lord Maderas, all those embarrassing
memories have us about to blow!

00:13:42.073 --> 00:13:48.273
You fools! Just tell her that the memories
are in your heads, why don't you?!

00:13:49.547 --> 00:13:54.246
Oh, so you hid 'em inside the heads
of these Prinnies, did you?

00:13:56.254 --> 00:14:00.315
All done! You can come out
now, Highness! Flonne!

00:14:01.225 --> 00:14:03.250
Curse you, Etna!
You betrayed me!

00:14:03.361 --> 00:14:04.521
Welcome to the club!

00:14:04.629 --> 00:14:05.755
Dood, I can't hold it in!

00:14:05.863 --> 00:14:07.626
I'm about to hurl!

00:14:07.732 --> 00:14:09.893
I wanna spill
the beans, dood!

00:14:11.269 --> 00:14:12.998
Keeps your mouths shut!

00:14:13.104 --> 00:14:15.265
Seriously, we're about
to blow, dood!

00:14:25.583 --> 00:14:29.383
Come forth, my minions!
Defeat Laharl!

00:14:38.663 --> 00:14:41.063
It's a wonderful life!

00:14:41.465 --> 00:14:43.262
Peace on earth!

00:14:44.001 --> 00:14:47.869
Let's all be friends!
Women, take the initiative!

00:14:48.372 --> 00:14:51.000
Laharl? Why are you losing
your strength all of a sudden?

00:14:51.475 --> 00:14:55.343
Oh, that. The Prince has a problem
with cheerful, progressive sayings.

00:14:56.514 --> 00:14:59.574
Now, my Progressive Sloganeering Squad!
Finish him off!

00:15:00.017 --> 00:15:01.575
A warm, caring heart!

00:15:02.853 --> 00:15:04.912
The beauty of compassion!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.053
Self-sacrifice for
the common good!

00:15:11.562 --> 00:15:12.722
Laharl!

00:15:13.731 --> 00:15:15.062
Heal!

00:15:18.836 --> 00:15:20.804
Laharl, hang in there!

00:15:21.205 --> 00:15:23.298
Joy and blessings
to all!

00:15:23.741 --> 00:15:25.538
Glory and enthusiasm!

00:15:27.044 --> 00:15:28.068
Heal!

00:15:29.013 --> 00:15:31.038
Laharl, don't let
them beat you!

00:15:31.248 --> 00:15:34.649
A loving heart!
Strength through faith in others!

00:15:35.019 --> 00:15:37.681
Heal!
Laharl, don't give up!

00:15:37.788 --> 00:15:39.415
Kindness and affection!

00:15:39.523 --> 00:15:41.582
Heal!
C'mon, Laharl!

00:15:41.692 --> 00:15:43.057
A noble heart!

00:15:43.427 --> 00:15:44.985
Heal!
Laharl, you can...

00:15:45.963 --> 00:15:48.523
Hey! Are you sure you're not
just playing games with me?!

00:15:48.833 --> 00:15:50.323
I'm not playing games
with you!

00:15:50.434 --> 00:15:53.096
But if you asked me if I was having
having fun, I'd be lying if I said I wasn't.

00:15:53.471 --> 00:15:57.339
I'll devote my life to keeping you safe!
Let's keep on loving each other!

00:15:57.808 --> 00:16:00.572
To you I pledge my
eternal love!

00:16:01.679 --> 00:16:04.375
That's wonderful! Those are
my two favorite words!

00:16:04.582 --> 00:16:06.049
Eternal love!

00:16:07.952 --> 00:16:10.477
Are you trying to kill me,
you loony angel?!

00:16:10.654 --> 00:16:12.645
How dare you spout off the words
I hate more than...

00:16:12.757 --> 00:16:15.555
Eternal love! Eternal love!

00:16:15.893 --> 00:16:18.987
Eternal love! Eternal love!

00:16:19.096 --> 00:16:21.462
Love forever!

00:16:21.999 --> 00:16:23.626
Laharl! Hang in there!

00:16:26.437 --> 00:16:29.429
Highness, I'll give you a little
going-away present before you die.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:36.912
You know the bun that Krichevskoy choked
to death on? Well, I had it specially made.

00:16:41.419 --> 00:16:43.387
Now, here is
today's question.

00:16:44.088 --> 00:16:46.352
Here we see two steamed buns
of the damned.

00:16:46.457 --> 00:16:50.052
One of them is delicious,
and one of them tastes terrible.

00:16:50.161 --> 00:16:53.096
Now, choose the
delicious one.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.959
Never make a decision based on
something's outward appearance, Laharl.

00:17:00.304 --> 00:17:01.999
See with your
mind's eye.

00:17:02.173 --> 00:17:03.299
My mind's eye?

00:17:03.407 --> 00:17:06.899
Yes. You can be deceived by
appearances and empty words,

00:17:07.244 --> 00:17:10.543
and relying on your eyes and ears alone
give rise to doubt and indecision.

00:17:10.781 --> 00:17:15.445
Open your mind's eye, and you
will see everything clearly.

00:17:16.053 --> 00:17:18.886
My mind's eye...
My mind's eye...

00:17:20.191 --> 00:17:23.285
Which one did I choose
back then?

00:17:23.661 --> 00:17:26.027
Which one?
Which one?

00:17:26.464 --> 00:17:28.091
Which was it?!

00:17:38.242 --> 00:17:40.938
Come on, Highness!
Don't bother me over here!

00:17:44.682 --> 00:17:49.244
Now, then, Laharl! Meet the same
pathetic end as your father did!

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.947
Etna, you're no longer of
any use to me, either.

00:17:52.056 --> 00:17:55.651
The three of you will eat these
poisoned buns and die!

00:18:00.764 --> 00:18:03.631
You're through preying on
my weaknesses, Maderas!

00:18:03.968 --> 00:18:08.735
And as much as I hate my father, nobody
is allowed to badmouth him but ME!

00:18:09.473 --> 00:18:11.805
The shoe's on the
other foot, Maderas!

00:18:12.276 --> 00:18:13.766
Progressive Sloganeering Squad!

00:18:17.281 --> 00:18:19.112
Etna! What are you
waiting for?!

00:18:20.551 --> 00:18:22.849
I command you!
Kill Laharl!

00:18:27.391 --> 00:18:29.154
Why don't you do
it yourself?

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:33.091
I'll reveal your embarrassing secrets
to the world! Is that what you want?!

00:18:33.397 --> 00:18:34.830
Do whatever you want.

00:18:34.932 --> 00:18:36.957
What did you say?

00:18:37.167 --> 00:18:39.431
You're the lowest of the low,
you know that?!

00:18:57.988 --> 00:19:01.253
Two years ago,
when King Krichevskoy died,

00:19:01.792 --> 00:19:05.421
I followed your orders and
tried to poison the Prince.

00:19:06.497 --> 00:19:08.055
You poisoned Laharl?!

00:19:08.165 --> 00:19:11.293
That's right!
So why isn't he dead?!

00:19:11.502 --> 00:19:14.528
Come to think of it, you only
fell asleep, didn't you, Laharl?

00:19:14.638 --> 00:19:16.367
Exactly! Why did it only
put you to sleep?!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.104
Because I'm me,
that's why!

00:19:19.877 --> 00:19:20.969
Why?

00:19:21.312 --> 00:19:26.511
I figured I could become Overlord if you
were dead or just asleep, Highness.

00:19:27.618 --> 00:19:30.644
And so, I'm getting out from
under your thumb as of today.

00:19:31.021 --> 00:19:33.956
From now on, I'm gonna live my life
the way I see fit!

00:19:34.358 --> 00:19:36.189
That's telling him, Etna!

00:19:37.761 --> 00:19:40.229
Got it? The real reason
I came here...

00:19:40.331 --> 00:19:44.131
was because of a total bastard by the
name of Maderas who ruined my life!

00:19:44.234 --> 00:19:48.728
And to get exact my revenge on him in the most
horrific way possible when the timing was right!

00:19:50.474 --> 00:19:52.533
We can't hold it in, dood!

00:20:12.363 --> 00:20:13.455
Where are we?

00:20:13.564 --> 00:20:18.024
I get the feeling that I've been exposed to
something terribly, terribly embarrassing...

00:20:18.302 --> 00:20:18.961
Yeah.

00:20:19.069 --> 00:20:20.934
NOOOO!

00:20:21.305 --> 00:20:23.296
Don't you dare remember
what you saw!

00:20:23.641 --> 00:20:25.006
Why, you!

00:20:25.109 --> 00:20:29.671
First you poison me, and then you use me as
bait to lure out the guy you wanted revenge on!

00:20:29.813 --> 00:20:31.440
You're one hell of a vassal,
you know that?!

00:20:31.749 --> 00:20:33.273
But Laharl, she was only...

00:20:34.852 --> 00:20:35.876
However!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:39.583
I can't say that I have a problem
with what you did.

00:20:41.091 --> 00:20:46.290
Even if deep down I was thinking, "If only the
Prince were dead, I could become Overlord"?

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:51.299
Or even, "I'll tag along with the Prince,
and if he ever proves to be..."

00:20:51.402 --> 00:20:54.963
"...unfit to be Overlord, SHLIK! I'll stab him
right in the back"?

00:20:56.040 --> 00:21:01.569
A true demon is always full of ambition
and aiming for the top.

00:21:01.979 --> 00:21:06.916
A demon like you might just be worthy of being
the mighty Laharl's most trusted retainer.

00:21:10.521 --> 00:21:11.283
What now?

00:21:11.388 --> 00:21:14.255
Right! Let's shake on it
and be friends! There!

00:21:14.358 --> 00:21:16.121
Don't be an idiot!
Let's go!

00:21:20.431 --> 00:21:22.592
Always look at things
with your mind's eye.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:26.192
Both at steamed buns
and at the world around you.

00:21:26.503 --> 00:21:29.768
And so, the answer is that
BOTH of them tasted terrible!

00:21:29.873 --> 00:21:31.568
Gotcha!

00:21:32.142 --> 00:21:33.439
One of these days...

00:21:33.544 --> 00:21:34.943
...I'm gonna kill him!

00:21:35.212 --> 00:21:36.645
He's already dead,
Highness.

00:21:36.914 --> 00:21:39.439
More to the point, what
did you do with Maderas?

00:21:39.616 --> 00:21:42.813
Oh, I locked him
inside that game!

00:21:44.621 --> 00:21:48.557
I've gotten my revenge now,
so all's well that ends well, Highness!

00:21:48.659 --> 00:21:49.819
Like hell it is!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:51.689
Wait a minute,
Highness!

00:21:51.862 --> 00:21:54.353
Take a look!
Here's your reward money!

00:21:54.765 --> 00:21:56.699
What? Why didn't you
say something sooner?!

00:21:56.834 --> 00:22:01.294
You can only look!
I found it, so it belongs to me!

00:22:01.405 --> 00:22:04.897
What? How dare a vassal talk to me
like that?! Shut up and hand it over!

00:22:05.743 --> 00:22:09.270
That reminds me, where do you suppose
those three Prinnies went?

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:15.748
Oh, one can't look at this
memory without crying!

00:22:16.153 --> 00:22:17.415
What's this set like?

00:22:18.589 --> 00:22:21.023
This is incredible!
I'm crying like a baby!

00:22:21.759 --> 00:22:24.853
Tears are such
wonderful things!

00:22:41.245 --> 00:22:48.674
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:49.019 --> 00:22:56.755
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:04.899
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:05.002 --> 00:23:11.965
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:12.643 --> 00:23:20.414
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:20.517 --> 00:23:28.219
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:28.325 --> 00:23:40.066
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:44.163
...hikari to kage
wa kurikaesu.

00:23:45.075 --> 00:23:49.375
Chain react.

00:23:56.753 --> 00:23:58.311
Big brother!

00:23:58.488 --> 00:24:02.652
I've missed you for so, so long,
big brother!

00:24:02.759 --> 00:24:04.522
What's with you?
You're creeping me out!

00:24:04.628 --> 00:24:10.464
Big brother, from now on, we're gonna
be together forever and ever and ever!

00:24:10.567 --> 00:24:12.865
Damn it, who's this "big brother"
you keep talking about?!

00:24:13.337 --> 00:24:18.673
Next time on Disgaea!
"Netherworld Siblings"!

00:24:19.543 --> 00:24:20.277
Big brother!

00:24:20.277 --> 00:24:21.411
Next Time:
Netherworld Siblings
Big brother!

00:24:21.411 --> 00:24:22.813
Next Time:
Netherworld Siblings
STOP DOING THAT!

00:24:22.813 --> 00:24:25.145
Next Time:
Netherworld Siblings
